<title>USA: Gulf Canada Resources seen issuing debt.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada Resources seen issuing debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd is expected to issue on Tuesday US$225 million in debentures via Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The 20-year non-callable Ba1/BB-plus debentures have price in the 125 basis point area.</p>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd is a large independent petroleum exploration and production company, located in Calgary, Alberta.</p>
<p>((--Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678)</p>
</text>
